      "statement": "build_tracer binds per-task invariants up front: it calls the task object directly only if __call__ is overridden, picks up before_start/on_success/after_return hooks only if overridden, and enables redelivery de-duplication only for acks_late tasks with worker_deduplicate_successful_tasks and a persistent backend.",
